  "qualification": "Paint and scroll pixels are measured with browser snapshots and isolated actual-display capture. Shape/shadow comparisons use browser screenshots in both headless and headed runs; they are not claimed as display capture. Six shadow cases use native CSS and two use independently derived CSS geometry in every browser (shadow-reference.md). All use flat 3x3 reference interiors with a 5RGB threshold and zero mismatches. Distinct per-sample RGB markers reject stale display frames; no pixel tolerance is relaxed. Earlier d25597f run44155167179 failed on Firefox native asymmetric inset; b18 fixes native double-paint and separates that buggy reference from analytic CSS geometry. Dock optics remains limited as stated in dock-optics.md."
